WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.220 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 31]

01:39.280 --> 01:40.380
We will help Your Highness

01:41.040 --> 01:42.770
wipe their power from the realm.

01:44.430 --> 01:45.490
That's our offer.

01:48.350 --> 01:49.570
I wonder

01:50.430 --> 01:51.490
if it's enough for you.

01:58.350 --> 02:00.690
Tang Linghuang is our...

02:01.230 --> 02:01.980
friend.

02:02.430 --> 02:03.980
He's also Lianyue's senior.

02:04.510 --> 02:05.260
Naturally,

02:05.400 --> 02:07.290
his life matters greatly to us.

02:08.080 --> 02:09.850
If you can help us

02:09.910 --> 02:11.170
rescue him,

02:11.520 --> 02:13.170
and purge the puppet poison in him,

02:14.680 --> 02:15.820
we'll owe you a great favor.

02:17.430 --> 02:18.450
As for what you said,

02:19.310 --> 02:20.940
borrowing my light

02:21.240 --> 02:22.730
to light Blood River's path...

02:31.360 --> 02:32.540
it's an honor

02:32.590 --> 02:34.170
for me.

02:46.520 --> 02:47.170
I believe

02:47.710 --> 02:49.450
you can bring the jianghu

02:49.840 --> 02:51.220
a brand-new

02:51.710 --> 02:52.340
Blood River.

03:00.560 --> 03:01.500
Not bad.

03:01.870 --> 03:03.130
That's a decent ending.

03:05.240 --> 03:06.220
This isn't the end.

03:06.910 --> 03:07.730
It's only the beginning.

03:08.680 --> 03:10.220
When Blood River is finally accepted

03:10.280 --> 03:11.100
by the world,

03:11.520 --> 03:12.060
Master Mu,

03:12.430 --> 03:13.940
what's the first thing you want to do?

03:14.960 --> 03:16.890
What I want most...

03:20.080 --> 03:20.820
The first thing

03:21.310 --> 03:22.340
is to pass the headship

03:22.590 --> 03:23.340
to Yumo.

03:24.190 --> 03:25.410
The first thing

03:25.560 --> 03:26.730
is to hand it off?

03:28.080 --> 03:29.060
My duty

03:29.430 --> 03:30.980
is to lead the Mu family

03:31.190 --> 03:32.260
into the light.

03:32.800 --> 03:33.380
Clearly,

03:33.630 --> 03:34.450
I've done that.

03:35.360 --> 03:36.130
As for

03:36.360 --> 03:37.660
the road ahead,

03:37.960 --> 03:38.980
that's for them to decide.

03:39.960 --> 03:41.340
My second thing

03:43.120 --> 03:44.060
is to go to Wangchengshan Sect.

03:45.000 --> 03:45.820
I'll meet

03:46.280 --> 03:47.540
the Profound Sword Deity I admire most.

03:48.150 --> 03:48.980
And I'll eat

03:49.280 --> 03:50.570
a peach he planted himself.

03:51.840 --> 03:53.010
Then...

03:53.400 --> 03:56.060
stay at Mount Wangcheng to cultivate?

04:00.120 --> 04:01.100
I did think so once,

04:02.240 --> 04:02.980
but...

04:04.030 --> 04:04.820
probably not.

04:05.750 --> 04:06.890
Why not?

04:07.750 --> 04:09.100
Because cultivation demands cutting off love,

04:09.840 --> 04:10.570
and I can't.

04:12.150 --> 04:13.340
My third thing

04:14.360 --> 04:15.380
is to tell Xuewei...

04:17.830 --> 04:18.700
I like her,

04:20.830 --> 04:21.540
and...

04:22.950 --> 04:24.140
I've liked her for many years.

04:29.480 --> 04:30.730
The previous generation of the Mu family

04:31.120 --> 04:32.020
in Blood River

04:32.040 --> 04:33.850
were terrors that made people quake.

04:34.390 --> 04:35.700
So how come your lot

04:36.160 --> 04:37.580
think only of romance?

04:39.000 --> 04:39.810
Sir,

04:41.120 --> 04:42.410
why are your hands so cold?

04:48.360 --> 04:49.730
When did you learn the Frost Palm?

04:50.510 --> 04:51.500
I didn't.

04:55.630 --> 04:56.250
Changhe...

05:06.390 --> 05:07.050
Let's head back to the Clinic.

05:15.630 --> 05:16.490
Master,

05:16.800 --> 05:17.810
are you sure

05:18.040 --> 05:19.810
this tonic won't overwhelm

05:20.240 --> 05:21.540
Changhe's body?

05:21.920 --> 05:23.100
It's way too tonifying.

05:23.360 --> 05:25.100
It's all blazing yang herbs.

05:26.720 --> 05:27.250
No matter.

05:27.510 --> 05:29.410
Su Changhe can take it.

05:30.040 --> 05:30.700
Okay.

05:53.680 --> 05:54.610
You're burning, then freezing.

05:54.920 --> 05:55.810
How is this possible?

06:04.560 --> 06:05.170
What's this?

06:05.630 --> 06:06.370
Changhe,

06:06.680 --> 06:08.660
my master told you to drink this.

06:11.600 --> 06:12.250
I'm not drinking it.

06:12.830 --> 06:14.100
Does this look fit for a human to drink?

06:16.480 --> 06:17.370
I tasted it.

06:17.750 --> 06:18.580
It looks black

06:18.630 --> 06:19.460
but tastes sweet.

06:44.510 --> 06:45.490
Without that medicine,

06:46.120 --> 06:47.730
you'll sleep an hour

06:47.950 --> 06:48.930
and wake freezing,

06:49.510 --> 06:50.580
another hour

06:50.870 --> 06:51.780
and wake burning.

06:52.310 --> 06:53.540
Then you won't sleep again,

06:54.310 --> 06:55.170
because you'll feel

06:55.680 --> 06:57.020
ants crawling all over you.

06:58.000 --> 06:59.660
Mighty Patriarch of Blood River

07:00.160 --> 07:01.340
ever suffered like that?

07:04.310 --> 07:05.780
Feels like being thrown back into the Furnace.

07:09.070 --> 07:10.290
The Prince of Langya

07:11.750 --> 07:12.340
is off.

07:13.190 --> 07:14.140
Maybe...

07:14.800 --> 07:16.490
he cultivates an extreme-cold style?

07:17.240 --> 07:19.050
That palm you took earlier

07:19.390 --> 07:21.290
hurt you with Frost Qi.

07:21.920 --> 07:22.900
His skills aren't weak.

07:23.310 --> 07:24.850
But if his palm could hurt me this bad,

07:25.070 --> 07:25.850
what right do we have

07:25.870 --> 07:26.700
to bargain with him?

07:27.480 --> 07:28.660
My Hell Palm

07:29.160 --> 07:30.340
draws in the opponent's Qi

07:30.390 --> 07:31.540
in a clash of palms,

07:31.680 --> 07:32.540
and strikes it back.

07:32.920 --> 07:34.020
So the stronger the foe, the harder it hits.

07:35.160 --> 07:36.900
But the Prince of Langya's Qi

07:37.950 --> 07:38.580
carries poison.

07:39.680 --> 07:40.370
What kind of poison?

07:41.480 --> 07:42.220
It's frost poison.

07:42.830 --> 07:43.370
That's right.

07:44.240 --> 07:44.900
It's frost poison.

07:45.310 --> 07:46.460
If it were Frost Qi alone,

07:46.750 --> 07:48.370
I'd just absorb it and strike it back.

07:49.600 --> 07:50.460
But the frost poison is tricky.

07:51.560 --> 07:52.540
With one palmful I drew in,

07:53.630 --> 07:54.540
it started rampaging

07:54.560 --> 07:55.490
all through my body.

07:57.600 --> 07:58.660
He poisoned you?

07:59.560 --> 08:00.220
No, he didn't.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.100
The moment he came in,

08:02.430 --> 08:03.170
I sensed something off

08:03.190 --> 08:04.140
in his look.

08:04.430 --> 08:05.930
He was invaded by frost poison himself.

08:06.510 --> 08:07.460
He hasn't long to live.

08:09.040 --> 08:10.220
Oh, really?

08:10.750 --> 08:11.490
But,

08:11.720 --> 08:13.020
isn't he a prince?

08:13.240 --> 08:14.540
With so many imperial physicians,

08:14.870 --> 08:16.580
how is he still afflicted?

08:17.390 --> 08:18.580
I heard two years ago,

08:19.600 --> 08:21.290
he led a southern campaign.

08:22.160 --> 08:23.140
Nanjue sent

08:23.190 --> 08:25.100
five martial arts grandmasters to kill him.

08:26.070 --> 08:27.610
All five were cut down,

08:28.270 --> 08:29.290
but one of them

08:30.040 --> 08:31.660
had reached the Free-Heaven level

08:31.830 --> 08:33.890
and practiced the Demonic Frost Art, Moon-Yin Finger.

08:34.150 --> 08:35.300
Maybe the rumor is true.

08:36.030 --> 08:37.180
No wonder

08:37.240 --> 08:39.180
he's so desperate to work with us.

08:40.390 --> 08:42.220
Seems he's cornered too.

08:43.630 --> 08:44.370
Can this frost poison

08:45.390 --> 08:46.220
be cured?

08:47.270 --> 08:49.370
I'd need to take his pulse

08:49.440 --> 08:50.820
to be sure,

08:52.150 --> 08:54.610
but from how he looked earlier,

08:55.320 --> 08:56.770
he's likely at the point

08:56.770 --> 08:58.100
of beyond remedy.

08:58.440 --> 08:59.530
Even if once

08:59.750 --> 09:01.250
there was a chance to treat it,

09:02.360 --> 09:03.300
by now

09:03.600 --> 09:06.440
there's at best a sliver of hope.

09:07.240 --> 09:08.610
As a man soon to die,

09:10.120 --> 09:11.460
what would he want from us?

09:12.510 --> 09:14.010
Maybe he wants our hand

09:15.030 --> 09:16.340
to purge Tianqi City

09:16.360 --> 09:17.650
of those plotting unrest.

09:18.390 --> 09:19.850
Before he dies, he wants

09:21.360 --> 09:22.460
to clear every threat

09:22.510 --> 09:23.820
for his elder brother.

09:25.870 --> 09:27.100
That's his aim.

09:29.150 --> 09:30.250
So noble as that?

09:32.320 --> 09:33.530
If I were dying,

09:33.870 --> 09:35.220
why care about tomorrow?

09:36.000 --> 09:36.890
The world

09:37.480 --> 09:38.340
would have nothing to do with me.

09:47.390 --> 09:48.130
I'm going into seclusion.

09:50.720 --> 09:51.370
Seclusion?

09:52.000 --> 09:53.250
That frost poison nearly crippled me,

09:54.080 --> 09:55.100
and it ties to my Hell Palm

09:55.150 --> 09:56.010
at the ninth level.

09:56.720 --> 09:57.980
I failed to break that threshold,

09:58.320 --> 09:59.730
so the backlash hit this hard.

10:00.480 --> 10:01.420
Once I reach the ninth,

10:01.870 --> 10:02.980
any frost or flame poison

10:03.390 --> 10:04.460
will be easy to dispel.

10:05.000 --> 10:05.530
All right.

10:06.360 --> 10:07.340
Then leave to me

10:07.870 --> 10:09.220
the other affairs for now.

10:13.200 --> 10:13.940
Don't rush.

10:15.870 --> 10:17.250
The Prince of Langya is at death's door.

10:17.670 --> 10:18.700
They're the ones who should worry,

10:18.720 --> 10:19.460
not us.

10:19.960 --> 10:21.010
If we send Tang Linghuang back

10:21.120 --> 10:22.940
safe and sound in just a few days,

10:24.080 --> 10:25.180
who knows

10:26.120 --> 10:27.060
what'll happen next.

10:36.440 --> 10:37.180
Who are you?

10:37.750 --> 10:38.420
Su Changli

10:38.720 --> 10:39.580
of the Su family.

10:40.550 --> 10:41.580
Yong said

10:41.630 --> 10:42.890
someone would visit today.

10:43.080 --> 10:43.650
Is that you?

10:44.080 --> 10:44.530
Yes.

10:45.120 --> 10:46.700
I'm Patriarch Su Changhe's younger brother.

10:47.000 --> 10:47.490
From now on,

10:47.600 --> 10:48.650
I'll relay messages

10:48.720 --> 10:50.580
between the patriarch and the first prince.

10:55.260 --> 10:56.140
[To Dian Ye, personal]

10:57.700 --> 11:00.060
[Prince of Langya bears frost poison, near beyond cure]

11:01.480 --> 11:02.980
Is what's written here true?

11:03.480 --> 11:04.850
I only pass messages.

11:05.150 --> 11:05.890
What is written

11:05.910 --> 11:07.340
was penned by Blood River's Patriarch.

11:07.790 --> 11:09.130
I haven't read the contents.

11:10.200 --> 11:11.060
If you doubt it,

11:11.480 --> 11:12.770
go doubt it yourselves.

11:13.240 --> 11:14.100
Don't ask us.

11:14.670 --> 11:15.490
You people of Blood River,

11:16.150 --> 11:17.130
what do you really want?

11:21.270 --> 11:22.730
You be emperor of Tianqi City,

11:23.720 --> 11:25.460
and we'll be king of the jianghu.

11:28.360 --> 11:29.220
Miss, have a look.

11:29.220 --> 11:30.000
[Soft cool breezes stir]

11:30.000 --> 11:30.820
[Chill cold dew drips]
Have a look.

11:30.870 --> 11:32.460
[Cold Dew today]
All from noted masters.

11:32.460 --> 11:33.360
[Season turns, days grow cold]

11:33.360 --> 11:34.290
[Layer up, keep warm]
Come take a look.

11:39.540 --> 11:42.660
[He-Yu Clinic]

11:43.790 --> 11:44.700
Morning, Miss Bai!

11:45.260 --> 11:46.080
[Kind Heart, Skilled Hands]

11:46.080 --> 11:46.850
Second Master Tu.

11:47.480 --> 11:48.340
You're looking well.

11:49.000 --> 11:50.220
Thanks for your prescription.

11:50.670 --> 11:51.530
Now,

11:51.600 --> 11:53.420
I feel strength to spare!

11:54.630 --> 11:55.850
Before, a few steps

11:55.910 --> 11:57.250
left me winded.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.100
Now,

11:58.320 --> 11:59.530
I can climb ten floors in one go

11:59.670 --> 12:00.530
without panting.

12:01.150 --> 12:01.580
Good.

12:01.630 --> 12:02.650
But you still need to breathe.

12:04.750 --> 12:05.100
Come on,

12:05.200 --> 12:06.220
bag a few more doses

12:06.320 --> 12:07.060
to keep him in tune.

12:07.390 --> 12:08.060
Got it, Master.

12:09.270 --> 12:10.580
With autumn winds up,

12:11.200 --> 12:12.130
internal heat flares easily.

12:13.750 --> 12:14.460
Thank you, Miss Bai.

12:14.630 --> 12:15.250
Much obliged!

12:15.840 --> 12:16.530
No need.

12:16.960 --> 12:18.180
You're here for Su Muyu, right?

12:18.440 --> 12:20.250
He went out early today.

12:20.670 --> 12:21.220
No,

12:21.750 --> 12:23.060
I'm here for you, Miss Bai.

12:24.620 --> 12:27.260
[Li Residence]

12:28.000 --> 12:29.610
Are officials in Tianqi City

12:29.670 --> 12:30.490
all this rich?

12:31.510 --> 12:33.300
How does this compare

12:33.390 --> 12:33.940
with your manor?

12:34.870 --> 12:36.700
Mine's bigger, of course.

12:37.150 --> 12:38.650
Then he isn't that rich.

12:39.870 --> 12:41.100
Because the Commander's manor

12:41.390 --> 12:42.460
is only this big,

12:42.790 --> 12:43.890
the Deputy Commander's

12:44.080 --> 12:45.130
can only be smaller.

12:45.360 --> 12:46.580
That's officialdom for you.

12:48.790 --> 12:50.100
Both of you, please.

12:52.960 --> 12:53.530
Master.

12:54.630 --> 12:56.650
This is Second Master Tu of Thousand-Gold Tower.

12:57.440 --> 12:58.730
And this is the physician

12:58.790 --> 12:59.700
he brought.

13:03.720 --> 13:04.460
We've met.

13:05.120 --> 13:06.610
I had the honor to visit you

13:06.750 --> 13:08.060
with my elder brother.

13:11.630 --> 13:13.180
You brought a physician this young?

13:13.910 --> 13:14.300
Yes,

13:14.550 --> 13:16.060
I'm this young.

13:17.270 --> 13:18.890
Don't let Miss Bai's age fool you, Sir.

13:19.000 --> 13:20.790
She's from...

13:21.390 --> 13:22.610
My skills speak for themselves.

13:23.910 --> 13:24.580
Okay.

13:26.960 --> 13:27.460
Sir,

13:28.000 --> 13:29.010
saving lives

13:29.150 --> 13:30.460
is a matter of utmost urgency.

13:30.630 --> 13:31.850
Don't block us here.

13:32.200 --> 13:33.490
Let me in to treat him, quickly.

13:37.240 --> 13:38.420
How do you know

13:38.840 --> 13:40.060
the patient is in that room?

13:41.030 --> 13:42.100
Because I can hear

13:42.150 --> 13:43.370
his breathing inside,

13:44.120 --> 13:45.420
nine short, one long,

13:46.000 --> 13:47.580
the long ending with a cough of blood.

13:50.750 --> 13:51.490
What does that mean?

13:52.510 --> 13:53.220
He's dying.

14:00.390 --> 14:01.340
This way, please.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.250
What's that smell?

14:14.750 --> 14:15.530
Mr. Li,

14:16.240 --> 14:17.700
we're here to treat you.

14:23.960 --> 14:24.650
Mr. Li,

14:25.600 --> 14:26.130
up you get.

14:26.550 --> 14:27.130
Wake up.

14:36.720 --> 14:37.850
Is this soul-loss?

14:38.550 --> 14:39.460
Soul-loss?

14:42.120 --> 14:43.180
If only it were.

15:10.840 --> 15:11.730
What's his condition?

15:12.790 --> 15:13.820
He's alive.

15:14.270 --> 15:14.850
Miss Bai,

15:14.910 --> 15:16.700
quit with the cryptic talk.

15:16.840 --> 15:17.480
He sprang up

15:17.480 --> 15:18.180
just like that.

15:18.240 --> 15:19.100
Of course he's alive!

15:21.440 --> 15:22.580
It's tricky.

15:43.080 --> 15:43.650
Take this.

15:57.080 --> 15:57.650
Miss Bai,

15:57.960 --> 15:58.650
what for?

16:00.120 --> 16:01.530
I'll take it back and refine medicine.

16:02.150 --> 16:03.770
This case defies a quick prescription.

16:04.440 --> 16:05.610
I need time to work it out.

16:08.840 --> 16:09.490
Let's go.

16:13.390 --> 16:14.010
Careful, Miss Bai!

16:21.480 --> 16:22.340
What a hassle.

16:22.670 --> 16:23.420
Miss Bai.

16:30.120 --> 16:30.770
What's going on?

16:31.670 --> 16:32.180
Nothing.

16:32.390 --> 16:33.460
He's only asleep.

16:34.080 --> 16:34.700
Second Master Tu,

16:34.750 --> 16:35.340
let's go.

16:42.360 --> 16:42.980
Miss!

16:51.270 --> 16:51.850
Hold on!

16:58.480 --> 16:59.980
How is my son's illness?

17:00.720 --> 17:01.340
His condition

17:01.480 --> 17:02.460
won't be cured in a snap.

17:02.790 --> 17:03.730
If it were that simple,

17:04.200 --> 17:05.290
those physicians you hired

17:05.480 --> 17:06.380
would've fixed him already.

17:06.640 --> 17:08.090
But none of them

17:08.830 --> 17:10.730
produced this specific reaction.

17:11.790 --> 17:13.220
That means their skills were lacking.

17:13.830 --> 17:14.380
However,

17:14.510 --> 17:15.860
I can at least let your son

17:16.070 --> 17:17.140
sleep soundly.

17:17.550 --> 17:18.420
Otherwise,

17:18.680 --> 17:19.860
if that state earlier

17:20.070 --> 17:21.290
last another dozen days,

17:21.550 --> 17:22.290
even if he doesn't die,

17:22.440 --> 17:23.570
he'll be a living corpse.

17:23.680 --> 17:24.050
Hey!

17:25.640 --> 17:26.570
Sir, rest easy.

17:27.000 --> 17:28.380
Miss Bai has a plan.

17:28.790 --> 17:30.220
Once the elixir is refined,

17:30.590 --> 17:31.900
Mr. Li's illness

17:32.030 --> 17:33.810
will naturally be cured.

17:41.030 --> 17:42.730
Cured?

17:45.400 --> 17:46.180
What's going on?

17:46.920 --> 17:47.770
I don't know either.

17:48.270 --> 17:50.090
The deputy commander sent men everywhere for physicians,

17:50.480 --> 17:52.250
and one turned up at Blood River's clinic.

17:53.350 --> 17:54.530
By the time we heard,

17:55.240 --> 17:57.050
the physician was already inside.

17:57.920 --> 17:59.090
Don't let her leave.

17:59.310 --> 17:59.860
At once.

18:05.480 --> 18:06.290
Can your people

18:07.640 --> 18:09.380
guarantee this job?

18:10.880 --> 18:12.010
You decide to act?

18:14.160 --> 18:16.090
Let's hope those Blood River folks

18:18.200 --> 18:19.530
don't disappoint me.

18:21.000 --> 18:22.220
Much obliged, Sir.

18:25.200 --> 18:25.860
Guards!

18:32.480 --> 18:34.620
Can you find a cure?

18:35.070 --> 18:35.660
Of course.

18:36.510 --> 18:37.220
But,

18:37.480 --> 18:38.730
it'll take a few days.

18:39.310 --> 18:40.700
If that's the case,

18:41.240 --> 18:42.090
please stay

18:42.160 --> 18:43.660
at my manor a few days.

18:44.550 --> 18:45.010
Sir,

18:45.790 --> 18:47.290
I brought the physician here.

18:47.790 --> 18:48.810
If she wants to leave,

18:48.960 --> 18:50.180
I'm taking her.

18:50.720 --> 18:52.700
If you mean to keep her by force,

18:53.310 --> 18:55.420
there's only one way.

18:56.640 --> 18:57.420
Which is?

19:00.070 --> 19:00.660
Kill me.

19:05.590 --> 19:06.980
You think I don't dare?

19:07.240 --> 19:07.900
Never mind my title

19:07.920 --> 19:09.530
as Second Master of Thousand-Gold Tower.

19:10.200 --> 19:11.700
Today, I'm just Tu Wan.

19:11.920 --> 19:12.900
If you want me dead,

19:13.750 --> 19:15.010
go ahead and try

19:15.960 --> 19:17.460
so long as you can shoulder

19:17.510 --> 19:18.250
the cost.

19:24.790 --> 19:25.620
Fine.

19:26.270 --> 19:27.730
As you wish!

19:29.000 --> 19:29.730
Whether I stay or go

19:30.200 --> 19:31.530
isn't for you to decide.

19:33.240 --> 19:33.700
Come on!

19:34.030 --> 19:34.490
Come on!

19:35.000 --> 19:35.660
All of you at once.

19:36.110 --> 19:36.860
Let's see

19:36.920 --> 19:37.940
who can keep us here today.

19:47.550 --> 19:48.090
Go!

19:54.350 --> 19:54.940
Who's there?

20:00.160 --> 20:01.380
You knew I'm here?

20:01.960 --> 20:02.530
No.

20:02.960 --> 20:03.530
I guessed.

20:08.270 --> 20:09.050
Who are you?

20:13.720 --> 20:14.980
Physicians heal and save lives.

20:15.510 --> 20:16.860
All should respect them.

20:17.920 --> 20:19.490
Yet you would cage one.

20:20.350 --> 20:21.420
How is that right?

20:23.640 --> 20:25.490
So, you're going to kill me?

20:27.030 --> 20:27.770
If I wanted you dead,

20:28.440 --> 20:29.490
I could do it anytime.

20:30.160 --> 20:31.420
But right and wrong

20:31.550 --> 20:32.860
aren't judged by might.

20:33.960 --> 20:35.140
You stand in the light.

20:35.960 --> 20:38.460
Treasure your power and rank.

20:41.750 --> 20:42.220
Let's go.

20:45.160 --> 20:45.730
Off we go!

20:59.550 --> 21:00.050
Also,

21:00.880 --> 21:02.090
if you want to make trouble

21:02.240 --> 21:03.250
for Second Master Tu later,

21:03.960 --> 21:04.900
then next time we meet,

21:05.640 --> 21:06.620
what I bring you

21:07.440 --> 21:09.010
won't be just sword energy.

21:09.750 --> 21:11.010
What madman are you?

21:11.310 --> 21:12.980
Do you take Tianqi City's Jinwu Guard

21:13.000 --> 21:13.940
for mere decoration?

21:15.160 --> 21:16.770
You're just a swordsman.

21:17.680 --> 21:19.940
You may kill one, kill ten.

21:20.550 --> 21:23.090
But if my Jinwu Guard comes by the thousand,

21:24.310 --> 21:26.010
will you survive?

21:29.590 --> 21:31.180
I don't know if I will,

21:32.480 --> 21:33.180
but you...

21:36.310 --> 21:37.420
will certainly die.

21:51.550 --> 21:52.330
Truly sorry.

21:53.000 --> 21:53.860
I thought

21:53.880 --> 21:54.810
it was a chance

21:54.880 --> 21:56.220
for He-Yu Clinic to make a name in Tianqi.

21:56.720 --> 21:58.220
I didn't expect the Jinwu Guard's deputy commander

21:58.310 --> 21:59.620
to be this unreasonable.

22:02.200 --> 22:02.730
It's fine.

22:03.480 --> 22:04.490
You meant well.

22:05.070 --> 22:06.180
Miss Bai and I will head back.

22:06.920 --> 22:07.570
If the deputy commander

22:07.750 --> 22:09.090
comes after you later,

22:09.590 --> 22:10.730
find us at the Clinic.

22:12.790 --> 22:13.420
Don't be afraid.

22:13.680 --> 22:14.700
We've got your back.

22:15.110 --> 22:15.700
All right.

22:16.480 --> 22:17.330
As for his son's illness,

22:17.510 --> 22:18.620
no need to bother, Miss.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.380
Let them fend for themselves.

22:21.480 --> 22:22.900
They should taste a little hardship.

22:24.000 --> 22:25.090
I'll take my leave.

22:25.550 --> 22:26.010
Mr. Su,

22:26.240 --> 22:27.660
let's go hear some tunes when you're free.

22:30.960 --> 22:31.490
Farewell.

22:39.070 --> 22:40.180
That deputy commander's son

22:40.350 --> 22:40.980
isn't right.

22:41.550 --> 22:42.090
Why?

22:42.640 --> 22:43.530
He bears puppet poison,

22:43.960 --> 22:45.530
but unlike what we saw

22:45.540 --> 22:46.550
in Sihuai City that day.

22:46.720 --> 22:47.660
This one is still alive.

22:48.510 --> 22:49.700
I have a bad feeling.

22:50.310 --> 22:51.290
Maybe Night Crow

22:51.400 --> 22:52.620
is seeping her puppet poison

22:52.880 --> 22:54.490
through all of Tianqi City.

22:54.920 --> 22:55.900
If even here

22:56.160 --> 22:57.900
a deputy commander's son is poisoned,

22:58.200 --> 22:59.250
then elsewhere

22:59.350 --> 23:00.140
others

23:00.200 --> 23:00.940
may be infected too.

23:01.440 --> 23:02.490
Are they trying

23:02.510 --> 23:03.420
to raise a puppet army?

23:04.070 --> 23:05.530
No wonder they've kept quiet

23:05.960 --> 23:07.050
all this time.

23:07.590 --> 23:08.730
Let's return to the Clinic.

23:09.400 --> 23:10.860
I took a drop of his brow-blood.

23:11.270 --> 23:12.770
I'll see if I can refine

23:12.830 --> 23:13.810
an antidote early.

23:14.070 --> 23:14.620
Okay.

23:16.830 --> 23:17.420
Be careful!

23:22.680 --> 23:23.940
What crushing blade aura.

23:32.310 --> 23:33.490
You're Blade Ghost Xu Liuyun.

23:36.110 --> 23:38.050
You're Umbrella Ghost Su Muyu.

23:38.640 --> 23:39.490
Many years ago,

23:40.510 --> 23:41.420
we met once.

23:42.160 --> 23:42.730
Yes.

23:43.960 --> 23:45.940
Shame we met,

23:46.590 --> 23:47.490
yet had no chance

23:47.550 --> 23:48.770
to test each other.

23:52.200 --> 23:54.220
Meeting again in Tianqi City

23:55.440 --> 23:57.330
settles that regret.

23:57.680 --> 23:58.940
You want a fight with me?

24:00.480 --> 24:01.010
Why?

24:01.590 --> 24:02.860
Sent by another,

24:03.480 --> 24:04.620
I've waited for you here.

24:05.790 --> 24:07.250
As for the physician behind you,

24:07.680 --> 24:08.700
her life

24:09.270 --> 24:10.530
will be taken here, today.

24:11.640 --> 24:13.220
So the famed Blade Ghost of Nanjue

24:14.030 --> 24:15.660
let Tianqi's powers

24:15.680 --> 24:16.380
use him?

24:17.920 --> 24:19.660
Didn't expect that.

24:21.680 --> 24:22.730
We're all just blades

24:22.790 --> 24:24.660
in others' hands.

24:25.110 --> 24:26.660
Isn't Blood River the same?

24:27.000 --> 24:27.900
Not anymore.

24:28.590 --> 24:29.900
We're different now.

24:31.880 --> 24:32.490
Miss Bai,

24:32.720 --> 24:33.900
when I clash with him,

24:34.240 --> 24:35.090
find a way to slip out.

24:35.590 --> 24:36.330
I've heard

24:36.550 --> 24:37.420
of the Blade Ghost of Nanjue.

24:37.590 --> 24:39.330
They say his skill rivals a Blade Deity's,

24:39.590 --> 24:40.810
but his ways are too bizarre

24:41.160 --> 24:42.220
to be ranked one.

24:42.920 --> 24:43.940
Be careful.

24:44.790 --> 24:45.330
Rest easy.

24:45.680 --> 24:46.290
No problem.

24:50.310 --> 24:52.570
Since they call you Umbrella Ghost,

24:53.000 --> 24:54.730
I'll gift you a ghost-breaker.

25:06.590 --> 25:07.180
Immortal-slayer!

25:53.200 --> 25:54.380
Without your umbrella,

25:54.590 --> 25:56.220
you can't use the Eighteen-Sword Array.

25:56.750 --> 25:57.730
After all,

25:57.790 --> 25:59.290
that's your deadliest killing art.

25:59.720 --> 26:01.090
My Spring-Rain Swordwork

26:02.110 --> 26:03.140
is enough to kill you.

26:07.480 --> 26:08.290
I see.

26:09.550 --> 26:10.420
You want

26:10.480 --> 26:12.220
to cast off those marks on you,

26:12.880 --> 26:14.490
the title Umbrella Ghost,

26:15.240 --> 26:17.220
the Eighteen-Sword Array...

26:17.640 --> 26:18.730
Do you know

26:19.720 --> 26:20.460
when a killer

26:20.480 --> 26:21.700
will meet

26:21.750 --> 26:23.180
his death?

26:23.590 --> 26:24.420
It's...

26:25.310 --> 26:27.620
when his heart holds

26:27.680 --> 26:29.090
more than killing!

26:54.480 --> 26:56.010
Don't treat me like dead weight!

26:56.400 --> 26:57.220
Now I see

26:57.270 --> 26:58.420
why you're only a Blade Ghost,

26:58.960 --> 27:00.490
not a Blade Deity.

27:01.920 --> 27:02.940
As long as I win,

27:03.510 --> 27:05.180
titles mean nothing!

27:08.920 --> 27:10.220
Horse-Cleaver fells immortals.

27:10.680 --> 27:12.140
Goose-Feather Blade slays saints.

27:12.640 --> 27:14.010
Miao Sabre breaks ghosts.

27:14.350 --> 27:15.980
Precept Blade banishes Buddhas.

27:16.200 --> 27:17.900
Gold-Ring Saber destroys deities.

27:20.110 --> 27:21.900
Be you immortal, Buddha, ghost, deity,

27:21.960 --> 27:23.460
or the greatest sage among men,

27:23.750 --> 27:25.810
all will die beneath my blades!

28:04.030 --> 28:04.700
Fall!

28:14.350 --> 28:14.940
Su Muyu!

28:15.030 --> 28:15.900
I've laid a poison array.

28:16.030 --> 28:16.860
He won't dare get close.

28:16.960 --> 28:17.570
Fight at ease.

28:17.790 --> 28:18.330
Kill him!

28:31.880 --> 28:32.420
What?

28:37.920 --> 28:38.860
I know

28:38.880 --> 28:40.250
why you use so many blades.

28:40.590 --> 28:42.730
You can't drive any single one

28:42.790 --> 28:44.010
to its limit.

28:44.590 --> 28:45.460
Therefore,

28:45.550 --> 28:46.660
you wield them all

28:47.720 --> 28:49.180
to mask your weakness.

28:49.720 --> 28:50.730
You're not wrong.

28:52.030 --> 28:52.810
But I'll kill you

28:52.880 --> 28:54.810
before you shatter the last,

28:55.590 --> 28:56.460
Umbrella Ghost!

28:56.830 --> 28:58.810
Now that Changhe and I lead Blood River,

29:00.030 --> 29:01.900
you should address me as...

29:04.720 --> 29:05.860
Master Su.

29:21.000 --> 29:21.620
All right.

29:22.070 --> 29:22.940
Master Su.

29:23.880 --> 29:25.180
You're worthy of the name!

29:47.270 --> 29:48.090
No one's there?

29:54.510 --> 29:55.570
You really think I'm that foolish?

29:58.400 --> 29:58.900
Miss Bai!

30:06.270 --> 30:06.860
Miss Bai.

30:15.920 --> 30:16.660
Master...

30:25.400 --> 30:26.330
Stop the bleeding for me.

30:29.350 --> 30:30.010
At my waist,

30:30.030 --> 30:30.810
there's a green vial.

30:31.350 --> 30:31.980
Take it out.

30:32.310 --> 30:33.090
It can save my life.

30:51.110 --> 30:51.940
Don't worry.

30:58.830 --> 30:59.620
Miss Bai...

31:16.270 --> 31:16.980
Useless!

31:17.680 --> 31:19.180
You wasted plenty of my Qi.

31:24.920 --> 31:25.860
You didn't use your sword.

31:26.440 --> 31:27.660
With only sword aura and energy,

31:27.720 --> 31:29.220
you killed my disciple at her side.

31:29.960 --> 31:31.660
Seems you care quite a lot

31:32.160 --> 31:33.570
for that lady.

31:34.070 --> 31:35.290
Yet you're merciless

31:36.310 --> 31:37.900
to your disciple.

31:40.110 --> 31:41.660
She can't move now,

31:41.720 --> 31:43.660
and could die any moment.

31:44.270 --> 31:45.980
If you still mean to shield her,

31:46.440 --> 31:48.180
it won't be as easy as before.

31:48.680 --> 31:50.140
Why must you kill her?

31:52.030 --> 31:53.770
She's the one least tied

31:53.830 --> 31:54.980
to this mess.

31:56.750 --> 31:57.860
Dragging her

31:57.920 --> 31:59.700
into this storm,

32:00.440 --> 32:02.140
do you feel guilty?

32:02.680 --> 32:03.330
Wind rises!

32:03.480 --> 32:04.290
Blade-Ruin Array!

32:26.960 --> 32:28.250
It takes time to break

32:28.310 --> 32:29.380
my Blade-Ruin Array.

32:31.310 --> 32:32.730
You won't live to see him.

32:33.720 --> 32:34.460
Die!

32:56.070 --> 32:58.140
You forced the array to save her.

32:58.680 --> 33:00.050
Had you let her go,

33:00.440 --> 33:02.180
you wouldn't be this badly hurt.

33:02.590 --> 33:03.980
What-ifs

33:05.480 --> 33:06.660
are meaningless.

33:07.240 --> 33:08.700
But in the end,

33:09.270 --> 33:10.290
I'm the winner!

33:15.440 --> 33:16.420
This blade's seen years.

33:17.110 --> 33:18.530
Thirty-two years ago,

33:18.590 --> 33:19.660
when I first wandered the jianghu,

33:19.750 --> 33:21.290
I bought it for two taels.

33:22.000 --> 33:23.570
It's broken three times since,

33:24.510 --> 33:26.290
patched and cased,

33:26.350 --> 33:27.730
sixteen years without light.

33:30.070 --> 33:31.810
Now drawn again,

33:32.880 --> 33:33.730
it can take

33:33.790 --> 33:35.860
Master Su's fine head...

33:37.920 --> 33:39.420
Lucky for it, I'd say.

33:40.200 --> 33:42.660
Take my fine head?

34:12.060 --> 34:15.540
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

34:15.580 --> 34:19.460
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

34:21.300 --> 34:24.780
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

34:24.820 --> 34:28.660
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

34:30.660 --> 34:33.940
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

34:34.060 --> 34:36.140
♪Still I can't let go♪

34:36.300 --> 34:39.740
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

34:40.220 --> 34:42.420
♪My heart no longer my own♪

34:42.540 --> 34:47.540
♪No one can escape from love♪

35:04.140 --> 35:07.860
♪How many hidden feelings♪

35:07.980 --> 35:12.060
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

35:13.300 --> 35:17.180
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

35:17.300 --> 35:21.540
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

35:22.660 --> 35:25.540
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

35:25.620 --> 35:29.860
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

35:32.140 --> 35:36.140
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

35:36.180 --> 35:39.620
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

